            {
                "entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                "word": "Libertarismus",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "de",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f21e80e6-4c44-4e0b-8c27-2f6168f142ff",
                        "entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "tags": [
                            "nominative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "der Libertarismus"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "452b6e16-05ca-4be6-a878-36c4786e8267",
                        "entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "tags": [
                            "genitive",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "des Libertarismus"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5e1df5bb-7ed1-4d15-96d0-07223cb44572",
                        "entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "tags": [
                            "dative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "dem Libertarismus"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e257ef08-0322-4e47-bb6c-77448acbe046",
                        "entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "den Libertarismus"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a355d0f-9302-3102-b06a-d7fe22d1a447",
                        "entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anschauung, die den ganzen Staat auf der Freiheit der Individuen begründet und an dieser misst"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4945c28b-74f0-4c31-a1c0-eb8924b78fe0",
                                "sense_id": "7a355d0f-9302-3102-b06a-d7fe22d1a447",
                                "text": "„Der Libertarismus ist eine Richtung der politischen Philosophie, welche die Freiheit der Individuen als einziges Ziel und alleinige Legitimation für staatliches Handeln anerkennt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ac6b508-894a-3d8a-a2ea-f7c88bb9a706",
                        "entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "glosses": [
                            "inkompatibilistische Denkschule, die von der Willens- und Handlungsfreiheit des Menschen ausgeht"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "des Geistes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5b6253a-e255-4123-b56b-54ff132d9efa",
                                "sense_id": "0ac6b508-894a-3d8a-a2ea-f7c88bb9a706",
                                "text": "„Ein spezieller Vorteil eines fähigkeitsbasierten Libertarismus besteht darin, dass er eine plausible Sortierung der empirischen und der normativen Anteile der Freiheitsdebatte ermöglicht.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1256497d-152c-4f6d-baf6-c0c3ddfc8ee0",
                        "source_entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a355d0f-9302-3102-b06a-d7fe22d1a447",
                        "target_lang_word": "libertarianism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "libertarianism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                        "entry_id": "f0990d8a-d572-32cd-b6e0-a899f99474f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A political philosophy maintaining that all persons are the absolute owners of their own lives, and should be free to do whatever they wish with their persons or property, provided they allow others that same liberty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00e96c84-996e-4b47-8e50-193e20a97014",
                                                "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, advocates of individual freedom not only continue to exist, but are increasing in number. Refugees from the Old Right, the Old Left and the New Left, they are organizing independently under the New Right banner of libertarianism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d36ea492-ec32-4e99-8f18-a6f9fa123554",
                                                "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                                "text": "The peculiar brand of libertarianism in vogue within technology circles means a minority of members—a couple of outspoken misogynists—can disproportionately affect the behavior and mood of the group under the cover of free speech."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29a497dc-ebbc-4554-8d3c-2d480d2be825",
                                                "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                                "text": "Isaacson reports that Musk’s fractured relationship with Jenna, who is trans, partly led to Musk’s rightward turn toward libertarianism and questioning what he considers the “woke-mind-virus, which is fundamentally antiscience, antimerit, and antihuman.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a3922b7-b443-3d69-9367-007629143a75",
                                        "entry_id": "f0990d8a-d572-32cd-b6e0-a899f99474f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The doctrine of free will, as opposed to necessitarianism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6723b3a9-e5df-48d7-b72c-caa87dae2c28",
                        "source_entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a355d0f-9302-3102-b06a-d7fe22d1a447",
                        "target_lang_word": "libertarianisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "libertarianisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6be0c9ce-d9b1-3613-afb8-7a604f0dea4d",
                                        "entry_id": "08a5e55d-74d5-3243-b038-5cb496933778",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Doctrine politique prônant un libéralisme jusnaturaliste, la liberté individuelle et le principe de non-agression comme principes moraux fondamentaux du droit naturel. Elle est basée sur le principe qu'un gouvernement doit avoir la plus petite influence possible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "neologism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39567667-c8b0-440e-a0a7-b0caf9e0d37d",
                                                "sense_id": "6be0c9ce-d9b1-3613-afb8-7a604f0dea4d",
                                                "text": "Le libertarianisme apparaît ainsi comme un Janus dont une face est compatible avec le néolibéralisme managérial, alors que l’autre permet l’hybridation avec l’extrême-droite identitaire et nationaliste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "541d8d7b-f560-4302-8a56-d71214e19e22",
                                                "sense_id": "6be0c9ce-d9b1-3613-afb8-7a604f0dea4d",
                                                "text": "Comme il l’a fait au Royaume-Uni et en Argentine par exemple, et comme il le fait aujourd’hui en France (lire notre enquête Le réseau Atlas, la France et l’extrême-droitisation des esprits), le réseau Atlas cultive des partenariats dans toute l’Europe, où l’on retrouve le même type d’alliance qu’aux Etats-Unis entre libertarianisme économique (anti-régulation, anti-climat, anti-fiscalité) et ultraconservatisme sociétal (anti-avortement, anti-minorités, anti-migrants)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7be104b9-ccfc-488e-951a-f9beda19e054",
                        "source_entry_id": "41a6ecf3-f618-3b7c-9884-b20e7c7b3389",
